v1.json`\n- `artifacts/method-map/v1-9709/source-visual-receipt.schema.v1.json`\n- `artifacts/method-map/v1-9709/pedagogical-visual-block.schema.v1.json`\n- `artifacts/method-map/v1-9709/question-render-asset-contract.validator-result.json`\n\n## Contract coverage\n\n- Encodes `QuestionRenderModel` as the default student-facing content surface.\n- Keeps whole-question screenshots fallback/debug/evidence-only.\n- Defines `SourceFigureAsset` as a source-paper visual object, not the whole question.\n- Defines `FigureAssetIndex` as a deterministic index over `SourceFigureAsset` rows.\n- Adds `SourceVisualReceipt` for replayable source-page lineage.\n- Separates generated learning visuals into `PedagogicalVisualBlock`.\n- Includes a QuestionRenderModel fidelity rubric.\n- Includes a FigureAsset anti-bypass policy for `layout_fragment`.\n- Preserves historical `qNN.png` crops as auxiliary by default.\n\n## Verification\n\n- Required first command in #1101 worktree: `npm run workflow:codex-preflight -- --json` - passed with expected branch-name warning and clean worktree.\n- RED smoke validator first failed because the four schema files did not exist.\n- JSON parse for all five JSON artifacts - passed.\n- JSON Schema syntax check for all four schema artifacts - passed.\n- Schema smoke sample validation for all four object types - passed.\n- Contract phrase scan for fidelity rubric, FigureAsset anti-bypass policy, FigureAssetIndex, and historical crop default posture - passed.\n- Forbidden display/authority scan - passed.\n- Staged path-boundary check under `artifacts/method-map/v1-9709/**` - passed.\n- `git diff --cached --check` - passed.\n- Final `npm run workflow:codex-preflight -- --json` - warning only for staged issue files / `feat/` branch naming; upstream sync, report guard, and A+ ratchet healthy.\n\n## Boundary confirmation\n\nArtifact-only. No DB migration, production import, ProcedureModel promotion, frontend runtime implementation, Supabase/remote-service mutation, crop repair, historical crop display promotion, scoring authority, or runtime eligibility grant.","created_at":"2026-07-01T06:14:24Z","updated_at":"2026-07-01T06:30:34Z","closed_at":"2026-07-01T06:16:08Z","merged_at":"2026-07-01T06:16:08Z","merge_commit_sha":"c15bd87cdfa9f435b3d9f031c541c7e5669a01fd","assignees":[],"requested_reviewers":[],"requested_teams":[],"labels":[],"milestone":null,"draft":false,"commits_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Samsen879/ciecopilot-home/pulls/1110/commits","review_comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Samsen879/ciecopilot-home/pulls/1110/comments","review_comment_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Samsen879/ciecopilot-home/pulls/comments{/number}","comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Samsen879/ciecopilot-home/issues/1110/comments","statuses_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Samsen879/ciecopilot-home/statuses/fd50e5f4a592204bd823266c0a41dd0467308ca0","head":{"label":"Samsen879:feat/issue-1101","ref":"feat/issue-1101","sha":"fd50e5f4a592204bd823266c0a41dd0467308ca0","user":{"login":"Samsen879","id":172257175,"node_id":"U_kgDOCkRvlw","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/172257175?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Samsen879","html_url":"https://github.com/Samsen879","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Samsen879/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Samsen879/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Samsen879/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Samsen879/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Samsen879/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Samsen879/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Samsen879/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Samsen879/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Samsen879/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"repo":{"id":99935